      "content": "the therapist thing is just more work. another meeting, another person to perform for, another person to explain how \"empty\" i am just so they can check a box. it's all just noise. everything feels so heavy and loud and pointless. i just want it to stop. i just want to finally have some actual, real silence where nothing is expected of me.",
